        <owl:annotatedTarget>ICD-10:G71.0</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:ECO_0000218 xml:lang="en">- NTBT (ORPHAcode is narrower than the targeted code used to represent it).
- Inclusion term (ICD-10: Orphanet entity included under an ICD-10 category and has not its own code).</obo:ECO_0000218>
    </owl:Axiom>
